5. Unique Elements
==============================================================================

Input:
[1,2,2,3,3,4]

Code:

List<Integer> result =
    nums.stream()
        .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
            n -> n,
            Collectors.counting()))
        .entrySet()
        .stream()
        .filter(e -> e.getValue()==1)
        .map(Map.Entry::getKey)
        .toList();

Output:
[1,4]

