37. Employee Salary Problems
==============================================================================

A. Highest Salary

Input:

John-100000
David-150000
Mary-120000

Code:

employees.stream()
         .max(Comparator.comparing(
             Employee::getSalary))
         .get();

Output:

David-150000

----------------------------------

B. Second Highest Salary

Code:

employees.stream()
         .map(Employee::getSalary)
         .distinct()
         .sorted(
             Comparator.reverseOrder())
         .skip(1)
         .findFirst()
         .get();

Output:

120000

----------------------------------

C. Highest Salary By Department

Code:

employees.stream()
         .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
             Employee::getDepartment,
             Collectors.maxBy(
                 Comparator.comparing(
                     Employee::getSalary))));

Output:

{
 IT=David(150000),
 HR=Mary(120000)
}

----------------------------------

D. Average Salary

Code:

employees.stream()
         .collect(Collectors.averagingDouble(
             Employee::getSalary));

Output:

123333.33

