MEMORY TRICK
==============================================================================

filter()
   → Even/Odd

distinct()
   → Remove Duplicates

sorted()+skip()
   → Ranking Problems

groupingBy()
   → Grouping Problems

counting()
   → Frequency Problems

flatMap()
   → Flatten / Merge

toMap()
   → List → Map

max()
   → Highest Salary

groupingBy()+maxBy()
   → Highest Salary By Department
